+
+// Linux build patch (Tuxchii): updates the AppImage from Tuxchii's own GitHub releases.
+//
+// The newest release ("Latest") is compared with this build: a higher version, or the same version
+// built again (releases carry "<!-- tuxchii-build: N -->", the build's workflow run number), is an
+// update. Installing downloads the new AppImage next to the running one, checks it against the
+// release's .sha256 file, keeps the running file as "<name>.previous" (for Roll Back) and puts the
+// new one at the same path, so launchers and game shortcuts keep working. Linux allows replacing
+// the file while it runs; the new version starts once this one has closed.
+
